<title>FINLAND: FINLAND BANK SEP DAILY LIQUIDITY NEED FIM 1.08 BLN.</title>
<headline>FINLAND BANK SEP DAILY LIQUIDITY NEED FIM 1.08 BLN.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Finland said on</p>
<p>Friday the required daily money market liquidity balance for the</p>
<p>rest of the month was 1.08 billion markka.</p>
<p>The central bank gave the following figures (FIM mln):</p>
<p> Liquidity estimate for Sept 3		     10,000</p>
<p> Minimum reserve requirement for Sep		6,406</p>
<p> Average reserves to August 29			6,863</p>
<p> Required daily balance for remaining period    1,084</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom, +358-0-680 50 245</p>
</text>
